ty to combine with the NEUE Emblem Frames."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuya is a dilligent and hardworking young man, but is rather docile and occasionally quite meek. He is also easily embarrassed, especially by members of the opposite sex. However, he is also courageous under pressure and cares deeply for his teammates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13535"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1dd2dafd018d8518f7ca34f1d67800a49faee1cb336086090f9345e4115fb414.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/22186004d87b7d3d96ac5050f82144b9b108de9a2e885f5de8671a24bd03c96b.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小田 久史","creatorId":"vndb:s1386","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1386","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1386","name":"小田 久史","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8401","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13536","characterName":"アプリコット・桜葉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13536"},"originalCharacterName":"アプリコット・桜葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"505"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Apricot, known to her friends as Rico, is a member of the Rune Angel Troupe and pilots the Emblem Frame Cross Caliber."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rico is a generally sweet and kind girl who cares deeply for her friends and family. She adores her older sister Milfeulle and tries to emulate her as much as possible. This can be seen in her choice of headwear, which bears a strong resemblance to Milfeulle's hairpiece."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She also has a fear of males, which manifests itself as superhuman strength. Should a male touch her, she nearly always hurls the unfortunate soul into the air. Tact is a frequent victim of this reflex. It appears to be triggered solely by the gender of the victim rather than threat level, as even males Rico trusts such as Tact and Morden (the Luxiole's doctor) are not immune."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13536"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79cebadef1b904af88831ba8c8df57b98206f2dc00b84ff65130bad6a7ee9654.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f7ff1d317104468923d683f8083b922fd749aebf9d0e88432b10c76057763e5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"稲村 優奈","creatorId":"vndb:s6272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6272","name":"稲村 優奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8405","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13537","characterName":"ナノナノ・プディング","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13537"},"originalCharacterName":"ナノナノ・プディング","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"813"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nano-Nano is a member of the Rune Angel Troupe and pilots the Emblem Frame First Aider."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a cheerful, active girl, and always ends her lines with \"-nano da!\". She considers Vanilla, who found her on planet Femto, as her mother. Because Nano-Nano is made from nanomachines, she can heal other people, just like Vanilla can. Her strongest source of nanomachines is from her tail."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13537"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67b746216784e889769d13e7b70dbe92d78547644a3004c818111f73472e53aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/4517414112412fa88fc4407b0d97df6b4cb7f0754b018454ca3f1f5c5b78be73.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"明坂 聡美","creatorId":"vndb:s5177","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5177","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5177","name":"明坂 聡美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8404","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13538","characterName":"カルーア・マジョラム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13538"},"originalCharacterName":"カルーア・マジョラム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"609"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kahlua is a member of the Rune Angel Troupe and her Emblem frame is the Spell Caster. However, Tequila pilots the Spell Caster much more often than Kahlua."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kahlua has an alternate personality known as Tequila Marjoram. Switching personalities involves a magical transformation that alters her mental and physical characteristics. The transformation is triggered when Kahlua consumes alcohol or a special medicine she makes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kahlua has a very quiet nature, and gentle personality. She is also known for speaking in a slow, laidback tone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a descendent of the Marjoram Bloodline, a family of very powerful sorcerers. She is very powerful when it comes to using sorcery, but she is not able to use most of her powers unless she is in emotional distress."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Anegl Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13538"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/880df91e96b89410224bddb88c5798b2c699cd76458f7384e6790c7fcc5dd695.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4165d320c655f83347dabe068e688affe83090dcfc9993493ce10176498da6ca.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平野 綾","creatorId":"vndb:s1500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1500","name":"平野 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8402","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13539","characterName":"テキーラ・マジョラム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13539"},"originalCharacterName":"テキーラ・マジョラム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"609"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tequila is a member of the Rune Angel Troupe and pilots the Emblem Frame Spell Caster."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tequila is an alternate personality of Kahlua. Switching personalities involves a magical transformation that alters her mental and physical characteristics. The transformation is triggered when Kahlua consumes alcohol or a special medicine she makes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Kahlua, Tequila is more impatient and flirtatious. Also, Tequila's bust size is bigger and she can use her full magical power."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13539"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d1fcf11a656d96b4f9985c7ec0f93d2484098dfe6724ca512c3494c691c5438.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06fa155f5e1e8f2f7681fe1bdfdbc2472264e3e00ef571a7359a8ea8ea88dd3f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平野 綾","creatorId":"vndb:s1500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1500","name":"平野 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8403","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13541","characterName":"アニス・アジート","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13541"},"originalCharacterName":"アニス・アジート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"910"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Anise is a member of the Rune Angel Troupe and pilots the Emblem Frame Relic Raider."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Anise embodies the prime traits of the tomboy. Armed with a hasty nature, flippant attitude, excellent piloting skills, quick reflexes, surprising wit, and the physique to outperform others, Anise fits the role of \"treasure hunter\" she so adamantly claims. Out of combat however, Anise's unfamiliarity with the strict guidelines of the military clash with her free-spirited nature."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Anise's love for activity meshes well with her hastiness and she is generally impatient and prefers to be doing something that tests her skills. As such, Anise is frequently found exercising or in the Recreation Room playing its myriad of games that sated her thirst for challenges. Naturally, Anise relished competition and never turns down a challenge from anyone who would pit their wits and skills against her. Anise respects strength and willpower and admires Ranpha and Forte for their capabilities outside of piloting."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13541"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0a7300118ce0c1588dce1d10dce71d79ac9d8924f5dde4d92dbf03cca717c22.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e24ac0a60d3ab7d6f62674f3f76101e315c9e75ce7aac645196d9dc8fa8dd8f4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花村 怜美","creatorId":"vndb:s6273","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6273","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6273","name":"花村 怜美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8406","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c13544","characterName":"リリィ・C・シャーベット","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c13544"},"originalCharacterName":"リリィ・C・シャーベット","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1102"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lily Caramel Sherbet was the original leader of the Rune Angel Troupe. She pilots the Emblem Frame Eagle Gazer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Serious and attentive, Lily is a strong young woman. A trained swordswoman from the planet Celdar, she nearly always carries her sword with her, even on vacation. She is a strong believer in teamwork and works hard to make sure the Rune Angel Troupe functions as a smooth unit. She occasionally expresses approval of group activities with, \"That's good training.\" She also sometimes uses English words during conversation (e.g. when she was stuck in a costume, she cried out, \"Mayday! Mayday! Emergency da!\"). She is also known for her tendency to express approval with \"OK-da\" and disapproval with \"NG-da\" (NG standing for No Good)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very loyal, and a strong believer in protocol (as she addresses other characters by name and rank as much as possible). She is also somewhat naive when it comes to certain aspects of social interaction due to her training. For example, she wears the skimpiest swimsuit of the Rune Angels because it offers her the most ease of movement."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lily is also a perfectionist. If she fails at a task will keep trying at it until she succeeds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Galaxy Angel Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c13544"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4a767a9913a5c079cba941aa8aae0075f58a64f4157ffdfcd6d13ae47f9b905.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4da6dd10151e970b9a13d505f91f5c52d2082f06eab26ed03754c3e003f7019.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中山 恵里奈","creatorId":"vndb:s6274","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6274","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6274","name":"中山 恵里奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:8407","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p412","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:730","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p412","name":"ブロッコリー","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:11518:730","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p412","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p412","name":"株式会社ブロッコリー","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:2012:v865","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p412","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p412","name":"株式会社ブロッコリー","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:50708:v865","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p412","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p412","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p412","name":"株式会社ブロッコリー","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:50709:v865","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
